'''Li'l Dark Cat''' (ちび暗黒ネコ, ''Chibi Ankoku Neko'', '''Chibi Dark Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Chopper (Deadly)|Li'l Axe Awakens!]]. It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Dark Cat
|image = E 324.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Chopper (Deadly)|Li'l Axe Awakens!]]
[[Path to +60|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy, despite its cutesy appearance, is viciously powerful, with a rapid attack rate, long range and 50% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] Cat Units for 5 seconds. That leaves enough time for Li'l Dark Cat to land nearly 10 more attacks once they get frozen, making it pretty much perma-freeze. Like all enemy [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark Cat]] variants, it isn't a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy.

Unfortunately for it, though, its damage is a bit low, so a high-level [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can sufficiently stall it and the [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angelic]] support in [[Tiny Chopper (Deadly)|Tiny Chopper]].

